# PROJECT: JOB KARENGE
## Complete MERN Stack Job Portal & Recruitment Management Platform

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, MERN stack developer, UI/UX designer, database architect, security engineer, and product designer.

Build a complete, modern, responsive, production-ready job portal named **"Job Karenge"**.

This must be a fully functional full-stack application, not just a static UI or frontend prototype.

The platform will connect job seekers with recruiters. Recruiters/admins can publish and manage jobs, review applications, shortlist candidates, schedule interviews, and select candidates. Candidates can discover jobs, apply, manage profiles, upload resumes, and track their applications in real time through their dashboards.

Prioritize clean architecture, reusable components, responsive design, security, performance, scalability, and excellent user experience.

